WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.098
When something needs attention, open the
tray icon.

2
00:00:04.668 --> 00:00:08.420
The popover lists each problem in plain
words.

3
00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:12.045
Each row names the file and the fix.

4
00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:15.747
Choose Show in folder to jump to the file.

5
00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:19.738
Fix it there, and the next sync picks it
up.
